  "report": "Spec retention review: CHANGES REQUESTED for one P2 producer boundary; the original failed gate custody independently verifies.\n\nP2 — race/freeze.py:54 and verdict/freeze.py:48. T04:353 requires “大负载按既有方式保存生成参数/长度/Hash，不复制无界正文”; R23:270 preserves input/output limits. Both producers stat the completed archive, later reopen it with archive.read_bytes() to hash its entire contents, and do not bind that read to the validated FD or enforce a cumulative read cap. Replacement/growth between those steps bypasses the stated creation envelope. Use one no-follow regular FD, exact expected-size fstat and chunked capped hashing. Preserve original creator bytes, archives and this report; review the prospective repair separately. This is a concrete static resource boundary, not evidence that the original archives changed.\n\nReviewed immutable3274ba4…eed4579,37 retention files. Bounded standard-library streaming independently verified all133177 race and64 outer regular members/inventory hashes, payload1304291193/40387698 bytes and archive SHA d4d61315…/28a657eb…. Original compressed sizes114046383/13522586 and fixed full-reader limits remain unchanged. All1056 selected source files match Git7931. Previous full ordinary proof is reused only after checking its archive/index/inventory/source/summary pins and exact cross-receipts.\n\nEach suite retains12451 cases:12445PASS/6FAIL/0NOT_RUN, audit0,98710 artifact references,868 true PIDIFF and29 named pressure PASS, including the fixed15 required IDs. Six GLM12 source/import/known-usage failures and full147627-byte stdout remain intact. Numeric commands are0/0/1/1; all8 format-verifier receipts are0; compiled public CLI exits1 with consistent reportfalse. STARTING/completed/reviews/build/helper/observer/17-directory plan and preapproval refusals agree across capsules. Public verification and eight negative results per new frontdoor were inspected as records only.\n\nRaw Messages cancelFAIL120001ms and absent own live-report remain distinct from the old matrix ResponsesFAIL. Strict publication/four-row assembly stay refused, matrix7fbe72… unchanged, no rows imported or certificate issued. Fixed-six102/102 plus immutable545/545 remains647/647; retention adds no paid calls or authorization. No ticket17 applicability upgrade, mandatory-acceptance closure, test/project/captured-code execution, Key/network access or repository mutation occurred.",
